    "/us/en/about/news/2023/features/new-spy-phi-technology--to-help-breast-cancer-surgeons-see-more-": { "template": "news-detail", "metadata": { "title": "New SPY-PHI technology* to help breast cancer surgeons see more during surgery", "pageTitle": null, "description": null, "image": "/content/dam/stryker/about/news/2023/features/new-spy-phi-technology--to-help-breast-cancer-surgeons-see-more-during-surgery/DSC03199.png", "imageAlt": "DSC03199", "tags": ["stryker:content-type/news/product-bulletins", "stryker:content-type/news"], "originallyPublished": null, "lastPublished": "2023-10-27T19:14:50.000Z", "contentID": "COMM-SPY-PHI-SYK-850569" }, "anchors": [], "disclaimer": '<p>References</p>\r\n<p>1. The American Cancer Society. \u2018Key Statistics for Breast Cancer.\u2019 Last Revised: September 14, 2023. Accesssed October 2, 2023 via https://www.cancer.org/cancer/types/breast-cancer/about/how-common-is-breast-cancer.html</p>\r\n<p>2. &nbsp;\u2018Highlights of prescribing information, SPY AGENT GREEN.\u2019 Accessed 1 October 2023.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2023/211580s006lbl.pdf">https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2023/211580s006lbl.pdf</a></p>\r\n<p>3. Weintritt, D. \u201CA Study Assessing the Safety and Effectiveness of IC2000 and SPY Fluorescence Imaging Systems (SPY-PHI) in the Visualization of Lymphatic Vessels and Identification of Lymph Nodes During Sentinel Lymph Node Biopsy in Subjects With Breast Cancer (FILM-B).\u201D&nbsp;<i>CTG Labs - NCBI</i>, clinicaltrials.gov/study/NCT03200704. Accessed 12 Oct. 2023.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>4. Breastcancer.org. \u2018Benefits and drawbacks of sentinel lymph node dissection.\u2019 Accessed 1 October 2023.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.breastcancer.org/treatment/surgery/lymph-node-removal/sentinel-node-dissection/benefits-drawbacks">https://www.breastcancer.org/treatment/surgery/lymph-node-removal/sentinel-node-dissection/benefits-drawbacks</a></p>\r\n<p>*SPY-PHI technology includes the SPY-PHI Imaging Systems and SPY AGENT\xAE GREEN (indocyanine green for injection).</p>', "forms": [], "tabs": [], "cardLists": [], "missingAlt": [] },
