    "/us/en/surgical-technologies/news/nurses-in-the-or": { "template": "news-detail", "metadata": { "title": "Nurses in the OR", "pageTitle": null, "description": null, "image": "/content/dam/stryker/surgical-technologies/news/2026/nurses-in-the-or/thumbnail.jpg", "imageAlt": "thumbnail", "tags": ["stryker:business-unit/surgical_technologies", "stryker:content-type/news"], "originallyPublished": "2026-06-16T13:59:41.000Z", "lastPublished": "2026-06-16T13:59:41.000Z", "contentID": null }, "anchors": [], "disclaimer": null, "forms": [{ "formId": "3248", "afterSubmitAction": "showMessage", "message": "Thank you!", "useProduction": true }], "tabs": [], "cardLists": [], "missingAlt": [] },
    "/us/en/surgical-technologies/news/one-caregivers-journey-to-help-reduce-surgical-smoke": { "template": "news-detail", "metadata": { "title": "One caregiver's journey to help reduce surgical smoke", "pageTitle": null, "description": null, "image": "/content/dam/stryker/surgical-technologies/news/2026/one-caregiver's-journey-to-help-reduce-surgical-smoke/ST_SmokeCamp_Wave2_Native_Image3_800x600.jpg", "imageAlt": "thumbnail", "tags": ["stryker:business-unit/surgical_technologies", "stryker:content-type/news"], "originallyPublished": "2026-06-16T13:59:21.000Z", "lastPublished": "2026-08-21T14:02:32.000Z", "contentID": null }, "anchors": [], "disclaimer": '<p>References:</p>\r\n<p>1. Canicoba ARB. Surgical smoke and occupational health. Ann Transl Med. 2022 Dec;10(24):1303. doi:10.21037/atm-22-5631. PMID: 36660725; PMCID: PMC9843373.</p>\r\n<p>2. N\xE4slund Andr\xE9asson S, Mahteme H, Sahlberg B, Anundi H. Polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons in&nbsp;electrocautery smoke during peritonectomy procedures. J Environ Public Health. 2012;2012:929053. doi:&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 0.8125rem;">10.1155/2012/929053.</span></p>\r\n<p>3. Alp E, Bijl D, Bleichrodt RP, Hansson B, Voss A. Surgical smoke and infection control. J Hosp Infect.&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 0.8125rem;">2006 Jan;62(1):1-5. doi: 10.1016/j.jhin.2005.01.014.</span></p>\r\n<p>4. Pierce JS, Lacey SE, Lippert JF, Lopez R, Franke JE. Laser-generated air contaminants from medical&nbsp;laser applications: a state-of-the-science review of exposure characterization, health effects, and control.&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 0.8125rem;">J Occup Environ Hyg. 2011;8(7):447-466.</span></p>\r\n<p>5. DVerR-021A-08 Design Verification Report \u2013 Filter verification rev. 1.pdf DIOVV D0000015644 UN1-1-3</p>\r\n<p>6. Ball K. Surgical smoke evacuation guidelines: compliance among perioperative nurses. AORN J. 2010&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 0.8125rem;">Aug;92(2):e1-23. doi: 10.1016/j.aorn.2009.10.026.</span></p>\r\n<p>Christy Kerling is a paid consultant of Stryker. The opinions expressed by Christy Kerling are those of Christy</p>\r\n<p>Kerling and not necessarily those of Stryker. Individual experiences may vary.</p>\r\n<p>A healthcare professional must always rely on their own professional clinical judgment when deciding whether to&nbsp;<span>use a particular product when treating a particular patient. Stryker does not dispense medical advice and&nbsp;recommends that healthcare professionals be trained in the use of any product before using the product.</span></p>\r\n<p>The information presented is intended to demonstrate the breadth of Stryker product offerings. A healthcare&nbsp;<span>professional must always refer to the package insert, product label and/or instructions for use. Products may not&nbsp;be available in all markets because product availability is subject to the regulatory and/ or medical practices in&nbsp;individual markets.</span></p>\r\n<p>Please contact your Stryker representative if you have questions about the availability of Stryker products in your&nbsp;<span>area.</span></p>\r\n<p>Stryker Corporation or its divisions or other corporate affiliated entities own, use, or have applied for the following</p>\r\n<p>trademarks: Neptune, PhotonBlade, SafeAir and Stryker. All other trademarks are trademarks of their respective</p>\r\n<p>owners or holders.</p>\r\n<p>Copyright \xA9 2026 Stryker</p>\r\n<p>ST-GSNPS-AD-3569700_REV-0</p>', "forms": [], "tabs": [], "cardLists": [], "missingAlt": [] },
